    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29160" root="عسى" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ عَسِىٌّ بِهِ</span></b>  <i>He is adapted</i> or <i>disposed by nature,
apt, meet, suited, suitable, fitted, fit, competent,
proper,</i> or <i>worthy, for it</i> or <i>of it;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَسٍ</span></b> 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ</span>: (K, TA:) but one should not say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَسًى</span>. (TA.)
[See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْسَاةٌ</span>.]

